<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>خطأ في الخادم | الكيف للسيارات</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.rtl.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.1/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Tajawal:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <section style="
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    background: var(--bg-primary, #0D0D0D);
    font-family: 'Tajawal', sans-serif;
  ">
    <div>
      <div style="
        width: 100px; height: 100px; margin: 0 auto 24px;
        background: rgba(227, 30, 36, 0.1); border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      ">
        <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle" style="font-size:44px;color:var(--red-primary, #E31E24);"></i>
      </div>
      <div style="
        font-size: 80px;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: var(--red-primary, #E31E24);
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      ">500</div>
      <h1 style="
        font-size: 28px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--white, #fff);
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      ">حدث خطأ في الخادم</h1>
      <p style="
        font-size: 16px;
        color: var(--gray-light, #B0B0B0);
        margin-bottom: 36px;
        max-width: 500px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
        line-height: 1.8;
      ">عذراً، حدث خطأ غير متوقع. يرجى المحاولة لاحقاً أو التواصل مع الدعم الفني.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/" style="
          display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
          background: var(--red-primary, #E31E24); color: #fff;
          padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 30px;
          font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;
          transition: all 0.3s ease; text-decoration: none;
        ">
          <i class="fas fa-home"></i>
          العودة للرئيسية
        </a>
        <a href="javascript:location.reload()" style="
          display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
          background: transparent; color: #fff;
          padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 30px;
          font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700;
          border: 2px solid var(--border-color, #383838);
          transition: all 0.3s ease; text-decoration: none;
        ">
          <i class="fas fa-redo"></i>
          إعادة المحاولة
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
